Mode: MULTI_CORRECT
Two or more answers must have "right": true.

Example:
{
  "questions": [
    {
      "question": "Which of these are fruits?",
      "answers": [
        {"answer": "Apple", "right": true},
        {"answer": "Car", "right": false},
        {"answer": "Banana", "right": true},
        {"answer": "Table", "right": false}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
